Spec: Invoice Service Tests

Platform: Python 3 / pytest

Purpose:
  Cover the fixture invoice service behavior without needing external systems.

Structure:
  ./test_service.py: Pytest behavior tests.
  ../src/invoice_demo/service.py: Service under test.
  ../src/invoice_demo/repository.py: In-memory repository test double.

Owns:
  ./test_service.py
  ./test_service.sdd

Can modify:
  ./test_service.py
  ./test_service.sdd

Can read:
  ../src/invoice_demo/service.py
  ../src/invoice_demo/service.sdd
  ../src/invoice_demo/models.py
  ../src/invoice_demo/repository.py

Must:
  Verify successful invoice creation persists the invoice.
  Verify invoice totals use Decimal arithmetic.
  Verify invalid invoice input raises ValueError.
  Keep tests readable as fixture code, not exhaustive production tests.

Depends on:
  pytest
  @invoice_demo.service.InvoiceService
  @invoice_demo.repository.InvoiceRepository

Scenario: create invoice test passes
  Given @invoice_demo.service.InvoiceService receives a valid request
  When ./test_service.py checks the returned invoice
  Then the total is Decimal("250.00")
  And the repository can retrieve the saved invoice

Example:
  service spec: ../src/invoice_demo/service.sdd
  service source: ../src/invoice_demo/service.py
